Error: hex #99 is not in this city's known catchment; see keryx city
Usage:
  build [city] [flags]

Examples:
  keryx build --list
  keryx build --type farm --hex 3,-1          # farm/mine/lumbermill/stonequarry are hex-bound: pick a catchment hex
  keryx build --type harbour          # requires coastal (adjacent sea hex)
  keryx build --type mine --hex 5,2 --province <province-id>   # build in a colony
  keryx build --type winery           # produces nothing unless a hills/plains/scrub_maquis tile is in catchment
  keryx build --queue                 # see what's already queued, with cancel-build IDs

Flags:
      --province string   province ID to build in (default: your capital)
  -t, --type string       building type (omit to see list)
      --hex string        catchment q,r or ordinal 6/#6 — required for hex-bound building types
      --list              show the building catalogue and exit
      --queue             show this settlement's build queue (with queue IDs for cancel-build) and exit
  -h, --help              help for build

